<title>USA: Microtest says CFO Douglas to retire.</title>
<headline>Microtest says CFO Douglas to retire.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microtest Inc said chief financial officer Richard  Douglas will retire on September 30, 1997.  Mr. Douglas, age 66, will continue as a consultant to the Company for the following six months.</p>
<p>Douglas has served as Microtest's Vice President, Chief Financial Officer and Secretary since December 1993. Prior to joining Microtest, he served as president of The Douglas Group, a consulting firm, from July 1989 to October 1993.</p>
</text>
